                                "sense_id": "8af8d63e-537e-33cf-9c6f-7988142fa597",
                                "text": "The whole of these silks have many faults: they are very nibby, which is principally owing to the water in which the cocoons are placed in order to have the fibre drawn from them not being of a proper temperature; […]"
