                                "sense_id": "8af8d63e-537e-33cf-9c6f-7988142fa597",
                                "text": "Adding nibs as a scrubbing agent to soap is easy and creates a luxurious experience. I use nibby soap to scrub stubborn soil from my hands. Nibs can be scratchy in soap, so this may not be best for delicate areas."
